      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Regroup as \\((1000 \\times 10)\\) \\(\\times 0.1993\\) \\(\\times 1993\\) \\(= 10000\\) \\(\\times 0.1993\\) \\(\\times 1993.\\)\n\nSince \\(10000 \\times 0.1993 = 1993,\\) the product is \\(1993 \\times 1993 = (1993)^2.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
